# System Flowchart

This flowchart visualizes the end-to-end process of the Invoice Validation System, from the user interface down to the OCR and comparison logic.

## High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    User([User Profile]) -->|Selects & Uploads Files| Frontend[React Frontend]
    Frontend -->|POST /compare| API[FastAPI Backend]
    
    subgraph Backend_Pipeline [Backend Processing Pipeline]
        direction TB
        API -->|1. Receive Images| Preproc[Image Preprocessor]
        Preproc -->|2. Grayscale & Denoise| OCR[OCR Engine]
        OCR -->|3. Extract Raw Text| Cleaner[Text Cleaner]
        Cleaner -->|4. Normalize Text| Extractor[Data Extractor]
        Extractor -->|5. Structured Data| Comparator[Document Comparator]
        
        Comparator -->|6. Calculate Match Score| Response[JSON Response]
    end
    
    Response -->|Return Results| Frontend
    Frontend -->|Render Dashboard| User
```

## Detailed Component Interaction

This sequence diagram details the function calls and data flow between specific modules in the codebase.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as API (main.py)
    participant PRE as Preprocessor (preprocessing.py)
    participant OCR as OCR Engine (ocr_engine.py)
    participant EXT as Extractor (extractor.py)
    participant CMP as Comparator (comparator.py)

    FE->>API: POST /compare (order_file, invoice_file)
    activate API
    
    par Process Order
        API->>PRE: _bytes_to_cv2(order_bytes)
        API->>PRE: remove_noise(image)
        PRE-->>API: processed_image
        API->>OCR: extract_text(processed_image)
        OCR-->>API: raw_text
        API->>EXT: extract(raw_text, type="order")
        EXT-->>API: order_data (JSON)
    and Process Invoice
        API->>PRE: _bytes_to_cv2(invoice_bytes)
        API->>PRE: remove_noise(image)
        PRE-->>API: processed_image
        API->>OCR: extract_text(processed_image)
        OCR-->>API: raw_text
        API->>EXT: extract(raw_text, type="invoice")
        EXT-->>API: invoice_data (JSON)
    end

    API->>CMP: compare(order_data, invoice_data)
    activate CMP
    CMP->>CMP: Compare Vendor
    CMP->>CMP: Compare Total Amount
    CMP->>CMP: Match Line Items (Fuzzy Search)
    CMP->>CMP: Calculate Match %
    CMP-->>API: comparison_result (Match/Mismatch, Differences)
    deactivate CMP

    API-->>FE: FullComparisonResponse (Order + Invoice + Diff)
    deactivate API

    FE->>FE: Display Results & Progress Bar
```

